              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='8'># of Orders Lower Threshold:</run>
                <run fontsize='8'> Delivery fee amounts with less than N orders with the relevant delivery type will be bucketed into &quot;Other&quot;.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>% of Orders Lower Threshold:</run>
                <run fontsize='8'> Delivery fee amounts with lower than N% of sub entity orders with the relevant delivery type will be bucketed into &quot;Other&quot;.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>DF Upper Threshold:</run>
                <run fontsize='8'> Delivery fee amounts (local currency) higher than N will be bucketed into &quot;Other&quot;.</run>
